Study on Construction Safety Risk Control of Earth Pressure Shield Double Hole
Undercrossing Expressway Subgrade
LI Xuechuang1,LUO Qiulin1,2,WU Yuepeng3
(1. CCCC Rail Transit Branch, Beijing 100120, China;
2. School of Civil Engineering and Transportation, South China University of Technology, Guangzhou 510640, China;
3. CCCC (Guangzhou) Construction Co., Ltd., Guangzhou 511466, China)
Abstract: Taking Guangzhou Metro Line 12 as the background, it studies the construction control measures of
earth pressure shield double hole undercrossing the expressway subgrade. After the analysis of geological
conditions and construction difficulties, the construction measures such as test section and controlling of
tunnelling parameters are taken, and the shield monitoring data are analyzed. It not only ensures the safety of
undercrossing construction, but also forms a comprehensive experience summary.
Key words: shield tunnel; undercrossing; expressway subgrade; test section; controlling of tunnelling
parameters;muck conditioning
